{
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "meeting_at_a_glance",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes, Tomás Beltrán, Bea Whitcombe, and Rohan Desai are meeting to agree on the Q2 retail plan, promotions budget, and the Greenfield Stores listing submission.",
          "citations": [
            "cal:M3"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "client_snapshot",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Kettle & Crumb is a snack brand currently stocked in 640 stores with a goal to reach 1,200 stores by the end of 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E57"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The engagement scope includes developing a retail channel strategy, a retailer margin model, and a promotions plan to support the expansion of the biscuit and snack bar portfolio.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D1",
            "doc:D5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Professional fees total £36,000 for a three-month project duration that commenced on 12 January 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fees are paid via a monthly retainer of £12,000, with invoices issued at the start of each month of service.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the Q2 trade-promotion budget: Bea Whitcombe confirmed it is £120,000 on 3 February 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E35"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says the total trade-promotion budget for the Q2 cycle is set at £95,000 as of 17 February 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hard deadline for the full Greenfield Stores listing submission pack is 27 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E52"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A switch to Pellam Packaging is expected to reduce unit costs by 6% across the board.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E39"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The oat-and-honey crumble bar has been selling 18,000 units a week.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E27"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "recent_news",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 9 February 2026, the oat-and-honey crumble bar secured the top position in the monthly supermarket new-product chart.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As of 9 February 2026, the company plans to expand distribution across additional regional territories.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 20 February 2026, Kettle & Crumb was named the Regional Snack Brand of the Year.",
          "citations": [
            "news:N19"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "where_we_left_off",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "On 11 February 2026, Bea Whitcombe reported a switch to Pellam Packaging to reduce unit costs.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E39"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 25 February 2026, Rohan Desai established the 27 March 2026 deadline for the Greenfield Stores submission.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E52"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 27 February 2026, Bea Whitcombe set a target of 1,200 stockists by year-end.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E57"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 3 March 2026, Rohan Desai inquired about the margin model as Greenfield Stores requested updated numbers for a session the following morning.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C24"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 6 March 2026, Priya Nair asked for a double-check of the promo budget in the deck and the status of the latest model version.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E67"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "open_items",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Commitment: On 16 February 2026, Tomás Beltrán promised to deliver the completed retailer margin model to Rohan Desai by 2 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E44"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On 3 March 2026, Rohan Desai noted that the margin model had not yet landed despite the 2 March 2026 promise.",
          "citations": [
            "chat:C24",
            "email:E44"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Commitment: On 17 February 2026, Rohan Desai stated the specific SKU list for the Tier One Grocer promotion must be finalised by Friday.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The hard deadline for the full Greenfield Stores listing submission pack is 27 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E52"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Priya Nair requested a status update on the latest model version on 6 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E67"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "attendees",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sam Reyes is a Senior Consultant and the day-to-day lead on all three engagements.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tomás Beltrán is an Analyst responsible for building the models and analysis.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bea Whitcombe is the Founder and CEO who decides the promotions budget and is ambitious regarding store count.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rohan Desai is the Head of Retail responsible for managing retailer relationships and the Greenfield Stores listing.",
          "citations": [
            "contact:P12"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "talking_points_and_risks",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "text": "Sources disagree on the Q2 trade-promotion budget: Bea Whitcombe confirmed it is £120,000 on 3 February 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E35"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The other source says the total trade-promotion budget for the Q2 cycle is set at £95,000 as of 17 February 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The retailer margin model promised for 2 March 2026 was still being requested as of 6 March 2026.",
          "citations": [
            "email:E44",
            "chat:C24",
            "email:E67"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A risk exists that the store’s own-brand premium line uses a similar colour palette to Kettle & Crumb, potentially leading to brand dilution.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D21"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vertical stacking of snack bars on middle-to-lower shelves makes branding difficult to distinguish.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D21"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The third-party logistics provider may need to adjust delivery windows if the small-format retail strategy proceeds.",
          "citations": [
            "doc:D10"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
